                        <summary className="cursor-pointer min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-0 flex items-center text-xs font-black text-[#00468B] uppercase tracking-widest">How manager notes work</summary>
                        <ul className="mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
                            <li>Only supervisors and managers see this panel and the Profile. That lock only hides screens: Dataverse security roles decide who can really read the notes, so the Employee note table needs a security role of its own.</li>
                            <li>A comment is plain text. A markdown note understands # headings, **bold**, *italic* and - lists; links are shown as text, never opened.</li>
