                            <li>The notes fold again after {MH_NOTES_IDLE_WORDS} without use, or as soon as you switch to another browser tab.</li>
                            <li>Pros, cons, snapshots and the rating are in the Profile: the Profile button, or double-click the person.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </details>
                </div>
            )}
        </section>
    );
}

// ============================================================================
